<title>UK: Glaxo shares drop on BZW comment.</title>
<headline>Glaxo shares drop on BZW comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Glaxo Wellcome Plc dropped in early trade on Thursday as analysts at BZW issued a &quot;short-term sell&quot; rating on the stock and lowered earnings estimates, dealers said.</p>
<p>Analysts at BZW could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was down 12-1/2p at 12.65 stg by 0732 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
